iews/","updateDate":1792753321000},{"id":"ru@dictionaries.addons.mozilla.org","icons":{"32":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-32.png","64":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-64.png","128":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-128.png"},"name":"Русский словарь проверки орфографии","version":"0.4.5.2resigned1","sourceURI":"https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/downloads/file/4270210/russian_spellchecking_dic_3703-0.4.5.2resigned1.xpi","homepageURL":"http://www.mozilla-russia.org","supportURL":"http://forum.mozilla-russia.org/viewtopic.php?id=25691","amoListingURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/ru/firefox/addon/russian-spellchecking-dic-3703/","description":"Русский словарь проверки орфографии","fullDescription":"Словарь подготовлен в рамках подпроекта OpenOffice:Lingucomponent:Spell Checking / Dictionaries. Содержимое этого словаря ничем не отличается от орфографического словаря, разработанного для ispell Александром Лебедевым. По сути, это тот же словарь, в котором набор слов и affix-файл представлены в виде, пригодном для обработки myspell. При сборке настоящего пакета использован набор слов и affix-файл из пакета rus-ispell.tar.gz версии 0.99g5, содержащего свыше 139 тысяч базовых слов и более 1.367 миллиона словоформ. При подготовке affix-файла русского словаря для MySpell приняли участие Анатолий Кирсанов, Александр Рабцевич и Александр Лебедев.\n\nЭтот словарь уже включён в русские сборки Mozilla Firefox версии 3.0.4 и выше. Если вы используете русскую сборку Mozilla Firefox 3.0.4 или выше, вам не нужно ставить это расширение.","weeklyDownloads":374,"type":"dictionary","creator":{"name":"Alexander Slovesnik","url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/ru/firefox/user/33236/"},"developers":[],"screenshots":[],"contributionURL":"","averageRating":4.6923,"reviewCount":10,"reviewURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/ru/firefox/addon/russian-spellchecking-dic-3703/reviews/","updateDate":1714063406000},{"id":"{60493d8c-aec8-448e-a247-5d2cfa047d69}","icons":{"32":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/2619/2619061-32.png?modified=8dbec6a1","64":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/2619/2619061-64.png?modified=8dbec6a1","128":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/2619/2619061-128.png?modified=8dbec6a1"},"name":"Ambient light for YouTube™","version":"2.38.17","sourceURI":"https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/downloads/file/4618615/ambient_light_for_youtube-2.38.17.xpi","homepageURL":"https://github.com/WesselKroos/youtube-ambilight","supportURL":"https://github.com/WesselKroos/youtube-ambilight","amoListingURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/ru/firefox/addon/ambient-light-for-youtube/","description":"Immerse yourself in YouTube™ videos with ambient light!","fullDescription":"This extension will surround YouTube™ videos with ambient light inside your browser. No need for extra hardware like lightstrips or smart lights like ambilight, it's all in your browser!\n\n\nTip:\n\nAre you using a widescreen or portrait monitor? Enable both the \"Remove black bars\" and \"Fill video to screen\" features to automatically fill your monitor with any video that has black bars.\n\n\nFeatures:\n\n1. Ambient light\n- Blur\n- Spread\n- Fade in duration\n\n2. Remove black & colored bars\n- Remove bars\n- Remove sidebars\n- Also remove colored bars\n- Fill video to screen\n\n3. Filters\n- Brightness\n- Contrast\n- Vibrance\n- Saturation\n\n4. Video\n- Size (scale/zoom)\n- Shadow\n\n5. Video page content\n- Shadows on elements\n- Buttons, boxes and images opacity\n- Hide elements in theater mode\n- Translucent header\n\n6. Quality\n- Limit framerate (per second)\n- Resolution\n\n7. General\n- Appearance (theme): Light, Default, Dark\n- Enable only in view mode(s): small, theater, fullscreen\n- Enable in Picture-in-picture mode\n- Enabled/Disabled\n\n\nAdvanced features:\n1. Ambient light\n- Edge size\n- Fade out start\n- Fade out curve\n- Debanding (noise/dithering)\n- Flicker reduction\n- Smooth motion (Frame blending)\n\n2. Directions\n- Top, right, bottom, left\n\n3. Remove black & colored bars\n- Bar detection offset\n- Bar detection average\n- Bar size (manual control)\n- Sidebar size (manual control)\n- Reset bars next video\n\n4. Video\n- Sync video with ambient light\n- Debanding (noise/dithering)\n\n5. Video page content\n- Hide scrollbar\n\n6. Quality\n- Synchronization: Display framerate, Video framerate\n- WebGL renderer (Uses less power)\n- Save energy on static videos\n\n7. Stats\n- Framerate stats\n- Frametime stats\n- Resolution and drawtime stats\n\n\nRequirement:\n\nA video card with a score of at least 1000 points in the PassMark G3D Mark benchmark is recommended.\nCheck your video card's score here: https://www.videocardbenchmark.net/gpu_list.php\nWith a score lower than 1000 the extension will still work but it is likely that the YouTube video page will be slow and/or stuttering.\n\n\nContribute:\n\nYou can view the source code and contribute to this open source project at https://github.com/WesselKroos/youtube-ambilight","weeklyDownloads":3668,"type":"extension","creator":{"name":"Wezelkrozum","url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/ru/firefox/user/15574965/"},"developers":[],"screenshots":[{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/278/278720.png?modified=1676412806","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/278/278720.jpg?modified=1676412806","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333,"caption":"Ambient light style variations"},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/278/278713.png?modified=1676412797","width":2304,"height":1440,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/278/278713.jpg?modified=1676412797","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333,"caption":"Dark theme"},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/278/278714.png?modified=1676412797","width":230